{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120610","id":3928106785,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7qIich","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120610","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120610.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120610.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120610","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120610/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120610/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120610/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a78bee1556945c2f4ee22b31aeb32eede7ac04bb","number":120610,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add global option to Copy/ConvertTransformModifier for reference bone","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4190\r\n- Another approach (but not conflict) with #120609\r\n\r\nAdd a global option when the target mode is set to “bone” in the Copy/ConvertTransformModifier.\r\n\r\nThis enables compatibility with models in which \"skinned bone groups\" and \"bones with parent-child relationships\" are completely separated.\r\n\r\nAs explained in #120609, scaling can be difficult when bones have parent-child relationships.\r\n\r\nIn environments that do not support `skin_scale`, when you want to adjust thickness via scaling, an approach is sometimes taken that uses constraints to separate \"skinned bone groups\" from \"bone groups with parent-child relationships\" like:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"154\" height=\"208\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20937eab-0905-49de-af03-56d4ffbcae15\" />\r\n\r\nAdding this option enables that approach and allows models to be ported to external applications that utilize it.\r\n\r\nThe basic visual behavior of this approach is nearly identical to that of `skin_scale`.\r\n\r\nCompared to `skin_scale`, the disadvantage of adopting this approach is that, similar to when using `cancel bone`, it requires modifying the bone and skinning structure.\r\n\r\nThe advantages, from a maintainer’s perspective, are that it is less invasive to the core than the `skin_scale` method; from a user’s perspective, it allows for extracting `bone_scale` from skinned bones and using `ConvertTransformModifier` to synchronize the positions of child bones. However, since the `ConvertTransformModifier` currently supports only a single axis, this is limited to cases where the axis from parent to child matches one of the basis axes.\r\n\r\nThe following video shows a comparison with the \"cancel bone\" method, including changes in length:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e991ba5-dfec-4b7e-ab4b-aee83a6bb7c7\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f15ef850-c3b5-46e8-bf89-e64bc5399c86\r\n\r\n[cancel-bone.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29295727/cancel-bone.zip) (needs this PR for demonstration)\r\n\r\nWhile both look the same, the \"copy global pose\" approach modifies length via position, not scale, so making IK available.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"538\" height=\"414\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22ea9900-d5e0-4140-8e78-7fd58afafb5b\" />\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github